## Why This Is Asked
This question tests practical knowledge of Azure security guardrails using built-in policies, Private Endpoints, and DNS.

## Key Concepts
- Deny public network access policy scope
- Private Endpoints and Private DNS zones
- Exemptions and rollback strategy
- Canary rollout basics

## Code Example
```json
{
  "policyRule": {
    "if": {
      "anyOf": [
        {"field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Web/sites"},
        {"field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Sql/servers"},
        {"field": "type", "equals": "Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts"}
      ]
    },
    "then": {"effect": "deny"}
  }
}
```

